// Resource ID 1 is not decoration: GPUI's Windows platform layer looks the
// window-class icon up by that exact ordinal
// (`LoadImageW(module, PCWSTR(1 as _), IMAGE_ICON, ..)`), and the shell picks
// the lowest-numbered icon for the exe. One entry covers Explorer, the
// taskbar, alt-tab and the window corner.
1 ICON "assets/rapidcap.ico"
